<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanshi" book-id="b-nanshi-051" chapter-id="c-nanshi-051-xiaozhengde-adoption" source-id="s-nanshi-051-xiaozhengde-adoption-ws2027179">
  <p id="c-nanshi-051-xiaozhengde-adoption:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-051-xiaozhengde-adoption:p001:m0000" ref="m5k_t3s_umk_A">正德</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-051-xiaozhengde-adoption:p001:m0003" ref="m5k_t3s_umk_A">公和</persName>，少而凶慝，招聚亡命，破塚屠牛，兼好弋獵。齊建武中，武帝胤嗣未立，養以爲子。及平建康，生昭明太子，<persName id="c-nanshi-051-xiaozhengde-adoption:p001:m0054" ref="m5k_t3s_umk_A">正德</persName>還本。</p>
